{"id":"n71343-3-8","stage":0,"title":"아버지 · 父亲","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71343-3-8-1","ko":"우리 지수 아버지 어디 갔어요?","zh":"智秀的爸爸去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们家的","explanation":"우리：我们家的；这里用于亲切地说自家人。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"3","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"지수","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀。","readings":[{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수","audio":"/audio/0d32317250d77806a4f2.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아버지：爸爸；“孩子名字＋아버지”可用来称呼孩子的父亲。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"3","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"갔어요?","meaning":"去哪儿了","explanation":"가다：去；-었- 表示动作已经发生，-어요? 是礼貌疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔어요","audio":"/audio/b1b0024d83172adc2137.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们家、咱家","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"用来亲切地指自己的家人；우리 지수 指自家的智秀。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"加在子女名字之后，用于指称或